# Force CRLF line endings for all protocol test data files (RFC 3261 mandates CRLF).
# Leading **/ matters: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to this directory,
# so plain `test/*.txt` stopped matching when the umbrella moved the fixtures to
# apps/elixip2/test/ and they got checked out LF-only, breaking SIPMsg parsing.
**/test/*.txt text eol=crlf
